      "description": "Legends for Supplementary Tables 1-11 of a human and mouse fetal gonad atlas, giving each table's file name (Extended_Table1-11.xlsx), its sub-table lettering, and per-column definitions. Tables 3, 4, 6 and 9 are per-library cell counts by cell type or cell state; 5 and 7 are cross-species transcription-factor prioritisation with full DEG and motif-accessibility column glossaries; 8 and 11 are CellPhoneDB interactions. This is the key to which Extended_Table file answers which question.",
